Exclusion Criteria:

* 1\. Small cell lung cancer (including lung cancer mixed with small cell lung cancer and non-small cell lung cancer);
* 2\. Lung squamous cell carcinoma, or non-small cell lung cancer with hemoptysis (\>50 ml / day);
